      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Local 10-min and 40-min myocardial ischemia was accompanied by a significant depression in the rat blood fibrinolytic activity. During 40-min postischemic myocardial reperfusion after short-term (10-min) myocardial ischemia fibrinolytic reactions were activated and after prolonged (40-min) myocardial ischemia they were suppressed."},
